The Den API conformance suite, as Den carries it

This folder is a copy of the conformance suite for den-api.sock
(docs/DREY-API.md), written by the client's authors, who check their client
against the same suite. Den changes none of its code, and its README only as
noted below: a finding is fixed upstream and the copy pinned again.

